    "concept": {
      "variant_id": "B1-v001",
      "brief_id": "B1",
      "direction": "soft_pebble",
      "name": "Soft Pebble Detector",
      "form_language": "Soft pebble silhouette: a low, slim, gently domed slab with continuous convex curvature on all faces so no flat panel reads as 'cheap box'. Corner radii are generous (8 mm plan, 5 mm vertical) making the part feel like a washed river stone in the hand while staying a simple 2-plate tool. Slim profile: 118 x 72 x 26 mm, mass ~173 g, achieved with 2.2 mm nominal wall and a ribbed inner face on the rear shell. Front face is a calm, uninterrupted surface: the display sits slightly proud in a shallow recess, the intake is a horizontal louvre band below it, and the USB-C is a recessed notch at the bottom edge, centred, so the cable drops straight down when the unit stands on a desk. No parting-line flash, no added trim, no light pipes; only a single pad-printed wordmark on the front lower right.",
      "silhouette": "pebble",
      "envelope_mm": {
        "length": 118.0,
        "width": 72.0,
        "height": 26.0
      },
      "corner_radius_mm": 8.0,
      "display": {
        "face": "front",
        "x_pct": 50.0,
        "y_pct": 38.0
      },
      "display_window_mm": {
        "width": 38.0,
        "height": 16.0
      },
      "intake": {
        "face": "front",
        "x_pct": 50.0,
        "y_pct": 72.0
      },
      "usb": {
        "face": "front",
        "x_pct": 50.0,
        "y_pct": 94.0
      },
      "cmf": {
        "material": "rABS",
        "finish": "textured_light",
        "color": "warm medium grey, NCS S 5005-Y20R (approx. RAL 7037 dust grey), matte",
        "secondary_ops": [
          "pad_print"
        ]
      },
      "intent_anchors": [
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA1",
          "statement": "Keep the pebble silhouette: continuous convex curvature on all six faces with 8 mm plan corner radius and 5 mm vertical edge radius, so the housing never reads as a sharp box and survives 0.5 m desk drops without corner chipping.",
          "category": "form",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA2",
          "statement": "Two-part shell only: front and rear injection-moulded rABS plates, joined by integral snap-fits (no screws, no separate bezel, no light pipe), with a single hidden seam on the side centreline.",
          "category": "cost",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA3",
          "statement": "Front-face layout is a vertical stack: display window centred at 38% height, horizontal intake louvre band centred at 72% height, USB-C recessed notch centred at 94% height on the bottom edge. Do not move or add face features.",
          "category": "usability",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA4",
          "statement": "CMF is rABS with a light mould texture (MT-11010 equivalent, 0.8-1.2 um Ra) in warm medium grey; texture must be deep enough to hide fingerprints and scuffs but shallow enough to de-mould from a simple 2-plate tool.",
          "category": "cmf",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA5",
          "statement": "Decoration is limited to one pad-printed wordmark on the front lower right; no paint, no soft-touch, no IML, no laser etch, no secondary colour.",
          "category": "cost",
          "must_preserve": true
        },
        {
          "anchor_id": "IA6",
          "statement": "Nominal wall 2.2 mm throughout, with 3 internal ribs on the rear shell for stiffness, keeping mass at or below 180 g and moulding cycle time short for the CNY 12 target.",
          "category": "durability",
          "must_preserve": true
        }
      ],
      "rationale": "The soft_pebble direction is the cheapest way to make a plain object feel intentional: a pebble silhouette needs only two simple plates, no undercuts, no slides, and no post-processing, which keeps tooling at the budget end. The slim 118 x 72 x 26 mm envelope leaves 7 mm length, 3 mm width and 4 mm height of margin inside the 125 x 75 x 30 mm contract, absorbing moulding tolerance and the snap-fit seam without exceeding the envelope. Mass is estimated at 173 g (housing ~81 g of rABS at 1.05 g/cm3 plus 92 g internals), under the 180 g ceiling. The front-face stack puts the display at a natural viewing angle when the unit sits on a desk, the intake louvre below it keeps dust away from the screen, and the bottom-edge USB-C lets a cable fall straight down so the unit never tips. Warm medium grey rABS with a light texture is the cheapest way to hide scuffs and fingerprints: the texture scatters specular reflections and the mid-tone hides fine scratches, while rABS is the lowest-cost material in the allowed set and supports the sustainability weighting without adding cost. Pad-print is the only decoration because it is the only secondary operation that fits the CNY 12 target; paint, soft-touch and IML are explicitly excluded. The intent anchors lock the pebble curvature, the two-part snap-fit architecture, the front-face layout, the CMF and the wall thickness so a downstream engineer cannot quietly turn this back into a sharp, decorated box."
    },
